Package: folimeld
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Folimeld contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= @LIBC_VERSION@), libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-shape0
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Description: PDF page editor
 Folimeld is a desktop application for rearranging, rotating, inserting,
 deleting, and protecting PDF pages.
